        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.395,
            0.7,
            0.486,
            0.743
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Do you know?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.506,
            0.624,
            0.818,
            0.73
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "in India. However, apart from fever, some other situations also affect the pulse rate. Hence, pulse rate alone is not a reliable indicator of fever."
            }
          ]
        },
